<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Allow to perform bit operations on integer values. </para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_exterior__product_8hpp">glm/gtx/exterior_product.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>
</section>
